  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, by reason of the internal layout of the lower ground floor Flat 2 and the rear openings within close proximity to the rear retaining wall, would result in poor outlook, an increased sense of enclosure and an overbearing impact, which would create a poor standard of living accommodation for future occupiers.  The proposal is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2021), Policies D3.D.7 and D6 of The London Plan (2021), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), the adopted Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010) and the Mayor of London: Housing Supplementary Guidance (2016)."
